<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_b7055603233c1c0f4eb95d296872d2466b7c6c1ce628b32a168905ebfc01f3e7_n0002/tu_0011> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Sildenafil\n86\n25 to 75 mg orally 3 times daily\nProspective randomized placebo controlled\n12 weeks\nn = 34\nNYHA II-IV, EF <40%\nYes\nMean PA pressure > 25 mm Hg by catheter\nThe change in peak\n\\text{VO}_2\nfrom baseline was greater in the sildenafil group (\n1.8 \\pm -0.7 \\text{ mL} \\times \\text{kg}(-1) \\times \\text{min}(-1)\n) than in the placebo group (\n-0.27 \\text{ mL} \\times \\text{kg}(-1) \\times \\text{min}(-1)\n;\nP = .02\n). Sildenafil reduced pulmonary vascular resistance and increased cardiac output with exercise (\nP < .05\nvs. placebo for both). Sildenafil improved in 6-minute walk distance (29 m vs. placebo;\nP = .047\n) and Minnesota Living With Heart Failure score (-14 versus placebo;\nP = .01\n). Subjects in the sildenafil group experienced fewer hospitalizations for HF" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_b7055603233c1c0f4eb95d296872d2466b7c6c1ce628b32a168905ebfc01f3e7_n0002/e_0081> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/ExtractedEntity> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_b7055603233c1c0f4eb95d296872d2466b7c6c1ce628b32a168905ebfc01f3e7_n0002/tu_0001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bosentan\n114\n500 mg twice daily\nREACH-1\nDouble-blind, randomized, placebo controlled\nn = 370\nNYHA III/IV\n26 weeks\nNo\nTerminated early because of liver function test abnormalities" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_b7055603233c1c0f4eb95d296872d2466b7c6c1ce628b32a168905ebfc01f3e7_n0002/e_0042/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingMethod> "NONE" .
